This crate is a modified version of MakeIndex: a Rust port of makeindex 2.18
as distributed in TeX Live 2026 (texk/makeindexk of the TeX Live source tree,
https://github.com/TeX-Live/texlive-source, tag texlive-2026.1, commit
6a300188053b8f2ded89dbd52293732a706b9c0e). As the notice below requires, the
whole modified work is covered by the permission notice that follows,
identical to the original. The machine-readable source of this port is this
directory of the FlashTeX repository (https://github.com/flash-tex/flashtex,
crates/makeindex); the original C sources are at the URL above.

